    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Skin color chromameter reflect chroma index method</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure color on two sides of 10 ripe undamaged and uniform fruit by using a chromameter, that includes chroma index, where a high chroma index indicates pale fruit and a low chroma index indicates dark fruit.</ns1:definition>
