      </ns3:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Collect ripe fruit from the field and freeze to −18 °C within 24 h and hold for at least 3 days. Postharvest fruit quality data are measured on ripe frozen fruit, using pooled and homogenized five-berry samples. Sample pH is measured using pH meter.</ns1:definition>
  </ns3:Class>
