    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Observe plants weekly and record plant collapse due to C. gloeosporioides.Begin scoring for disease 1 week after inoculation and continue until the conclusion of the fruiting season. Measure disease severity by rating plant collapse using S to indicate susceptible plants and R to indicate resistant plants.</ns1:definition>
