    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure total anthocyanins of room temperature, homogenized fruit pulp samples by combining fruit and any juice lost during thawing in a zip top bag. Total anthocyanins were measured using the pH differential method as described by Lee et al. (2005) as the change in absorbance at 2 different pH values of 1.0 and 4.5.</ns1:definition>
