      </ns3:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure color on two sides of 10 ripe undamaged and uniform fruit by using a chromameter, that includes three parameters: L* (Luminance) a* (red tone) and b* (yellow tone) where L* is a measure of brightness.</ns1:definition>
  </ns3:Class>
